duck-voice-color is a separate GPL-3.0-or-later executable.

It includes Rubber Band Library 4.0.0, copyright 2007-2024 Particular Programs Ltd,
under GPL-2.0-or-later. Upstream revision:
1d95888bec3ae0a17c0c4af791810d5a63f6bc35
https://github.com/breakfastquay/rubberband

The vendor directory preserves upstream sources and license notices. Its single-file
build uses the bundled FFT and resampler (Accelerate on macOS), with no system Rubber
Band, FFTW or libsndfile dependency. The main runtime uses this executable through
standard raw PCM pipes and does not link Rubber Band.

Loudness measurement uses ebur128 0.1.11, copyright Sebastian Dröge, under MIT.
https://github.com/sdroege/ebur128

The release includes the tool's source and build instructions under source/.
